    {
      "name": "5. Web (sesi + CSRF)",
      "description": "Laluan web guna sesi dan cookie. Jalankan **CSRF cookie** dahulu, kemudian **Log masuk**. Pre-request script folder ini salin cookie `XSRF-TOKEN` ke header `X-XSRF-TOKEN`.\n\nPada `master` hingga `modul-3-start` tiada laluan `/login` — log masuk melalui cara lain atau langkau.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "noauth"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const raw = pm.cookies.get('XSRF-TOKEN');",
              "if (raw) {",
              "  pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-XSRF-TOKEN', value: decodeURIComponent(raw) });",
              "}",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Origin', value: pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url') });",
              "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Referer', value: pm.collectionVariables.get('base_url') + '/' });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "CSRF cookie",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sanctum/csrf-cookie",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "sanctum",
                "csrf-cookie"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Ada sejak cawangan:** `modul-3-lab`\n\nSet cookie `XSRF-TOKEN` dan sesi. Pulang 204."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Log masuk (SPA)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
